  "body": "Ready for merge after reviewed implementation and full artifact-bound validation; actual-merge audit and automatic receipt remain required.\n\nVerified parent e789ce42bac28e084a4f0264180b738534d69923. Protocol9e234a484fa8943a380e95b8f781c4268cb0cc18 was committed before implementation/benchmarking. Historical scientific files and test bodies are unchanged. Source5c01fde4a84c9d273c7506a5a1c77e43eca4dcf0; verified publication cc08fbf0821714e3bc65e5c333a51c52ec36928e; run36774150749 passed science and fresh reproduction.\n\nMeasured v16.36 suite:147.767s baseline to50.179s optimized (~2.94x), same runner, identical12 test identities/outcomes and fixture hashes. Producer generations12 to2; all12 independent verifier calls retained. Scientific reconstruction plus complete inherited stack ran concurrently in92.642s; fresh publication102.099s. Single-run observations with optimized tests sharing CPU; no general timing guarantee.\n\nEach phase passed300 required tests:28 current scientific controls,261 inherited tests,11 infrastructure controls. Every scientific file equals the certified v16.39 bytes; source archives match across phases. Both downloaded artifact API digests/CRC, all1331 source members and all92 durable publication members independently checked against manifests and remote Git bytes.\n\nFast preflight rejects input/reference drift before expensive work. Fixture reuse is process-local, producer-only and deep-copied per test. No verifier result or scientific phase output is cached. Source review's two integrity findings were fixed: immutable parent Git anchors, and exact PR/actual-merge/workflow/parent/tree checks. Negative controls passed. Initial three-regression RED36772436790 retained; pilot36773149791 evidence remains in history.\n\nWorkflow now assembles and commits the receipt automatically on a separate branch after actual-merge replay. See tools/retained_ci/PROTOCOL.md, REVIEW.md, EXECUTION.md, REPORT.md and evidence/. This is infrastructure optimization, not a new numbered scientific stage.",
  "changed_files": 93,
